  "agent_notes": [
    "The official homepage catalogue enumerates ten degree programmes. The site also mentions certification courses and examples such as NISM, ACCA, advanced Excel, digital marketing, HR analytics, communication skills, and emerging technologies, but provides no complete named active certificate catalogue or dedicated certificate programme pages; certificate completeness therefore remains unresolved and the record is manual_review.",
    "The current public site has no usable standalone admissions catalogue page; the /admission and /admissions routes expose only the generic site shell, so eligibility remains null.",
    "The central homepage catalogue labels the bioscience master's programme as \"Master of Science (Bio-Science)\", while its direct /academics/msc page title uses \"Master of Science (Biosciences)\"; the central catalogue label was retained and the discrepancy contributes to manual review.",
    "Normal curl TLS verification produced the managed proxy error \"self signed certificate in certificate chain\". curl --insecure was used only for public GET requests after confirming the expected government, search, and official hostnames."
  ]
